{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your very own barn\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727090/extras/fb2edcf2ea4b30dde3e73f01fd95bedf.poster.avif?t=1761745227\" width=900 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727090/extras/fb2edcf2ea4b30dde3e73f01fd95bedf.webm?t=1761745227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727090/extras/fb2edcf2ea4b30dde3e73f01fd95bedf.mp4?t=1761745227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve finally saved up the money to get a plot of land with a run-down shack of a stable \u2013 It\u2019s not much but it\u2019s yours. Time for you and your trusted mare to start training, so you can participate in tournaments in the nearby town and grow your ramshackle yard into the stud farm of your dreams!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Take Care of your Horse(s)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727090/extras/91adc8899f30e9036008a14afa60c793.poster.avif?t=1761745227\" width=900 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727090/extras/91adc8899f30e9036008a14afa60c793.webm?t=1761745227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727090/extras/91adc8899f30e9036008a14afa60c793.mp4?t=1761745227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Groom and comb your horses in crisp, satisfying care interactions that are grounded in realism without being tedious. Use your brush and hoofpick to avoid saddle sores and abscesses, and treat scrapes and injuries appropriately when they happen.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Train, Compete, Explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727090/extras/27c7b762caf9061030cd5525959b1e23.poster.avif?t=1761745227\" width=900 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727090/extras/27c7b762caf9061030cd5525959b1e23.webm?t=1761745227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727090/extras/27c7b762caf9061030cd5525959b1e23.mp4?t=1761745227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete training exercises and build up your horse\u2019s strength and confidence to qualify for competitions and earn prize money. Take your horses out on trail rides for a change of pace and scenery \u2013 you get to enjoy beautiful vistas and you never know what you might find along the way!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Breed &amp; Evolve</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727090/extras/6940656b2366d75bd3718a61e17b125a.poster.avif?t=1761745227\" width=900 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727090/extras/6940656b2366d75bd3718a61e17b125a.webm?t=1761745227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727090/extras/6940656b2366d75bd3718a61e17b125a.mp4?t=1761745227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breed adorable foals to improve your stock over time. Carefully plan your stallion and mare pairings to bring out the best in your offspring, whether you\u2019re going for looks or stats.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade &amp; Manage\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727090/extras/f1b24f9ca063bced93f0631ac2c2d7f4.poster.avif?t=1761745227\" width=900 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727090/extras/f1b24f9ca063bced93f0631ac2c2d7f4.webm?t=1761745227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save up for upgrading your buildings to make space for more horses and better meeting their needs. Hire staff to stay on top of care and training for a growing herd.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Learn about the game and real horses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727090/extras/1338dbba537d7e783f1e23056acf8c03.poster.avif?t=1761745227\" width=900 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727090/extras/1338dbba537d7e783f1e23056acf8c03.webm?t=1761745227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727090/extras/1338dbba537d7e783f1e23056acf8c03.mp4?t=1761745227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horses of Hoofprint Bay is made by three horse girls who care a lot about these animals. While not every aspect of the game is completely realistic, we strive to be accurate and educational in every way that doesn\u2019t compromise gameplay fun. An in-game library contains a lot of relevant equestrian knowledge about in-game and real life horses!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize and Modify</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727090/extras/c8c3a5bb94478bbaf9702ce127aa8a71.poster.avif?t=1761745227\" width=900 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727090/extras/c8c3a5bb94478bbaf9702ce127aa8a71.webm?t=1761745227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727090/extras/c8c3a5bb94478bbaf9702ce127aa8a71.mp4?t=1761745227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Edit the appearance of your character and tack items with built-in color picking tools, or even modify the game files to your liking to create custom color palettes. Whether you prefer sticking to a curated selection of available customization items and color combos, or want to start digging into easily accessible textures and text files to alter the appearance of horses and characters is entirely up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3727090?t=1761745227","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727090/a10ff604dcbd2b1d8370d773c9ab4d142e127024/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761745227","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727090/e6f32d929aa54d405575c408eab6dc8e452bb740/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761745227","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727090/e6f32d929aa54d405575c408eab6dc8e452bb740/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761745227","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your very own barn\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727090/extras/fb2edcf2ea4b30dde3e73f01fd95bedf.poster.avif?t=1761745227\" width=900 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727090/extras/fb2edcf2ea4b30dde3e73f01fd95bedf.webm?t=1761745227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727090/extras/fb2edcf2ea4b30dde3e73f01fd95bedf.mp4?t=1761745227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve finally saved up the money to get a plot of land with a run-down shack of a stable \u2013 It\u2019s not much but it\u2019s yours. Time for you and your trusted mare to start training, so you can participate in tournaments in the nearby town and grow your ramshackle yard into the stud farm of your dreams!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Take Care of your Horse(s)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727090/extras/91adc8899f30e9036008a14afa60c793.poster.avif?t=1761745227\" width=900 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727090/extras/91adc8899f30e9036008a14afa60c793.webm?t=1761745227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727090/extras/91adc8899f30e9036008a14afa60c793.mp4?t=1761745227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Groom and comb your horses in crisp, satisfying care interactions that are grounded in realism without being tedious. Use your brush and hoofpick to avoid saddle sores and abscesses, and treat scrapes and injuries appropriately when they happen.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Train, Compete, Explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727090/extras/27c7b762caf9061030cd5525959b1e23.poster.avif?t=1761745227\" width=900 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727090/extras/27c7b762caf9061030cd5525959b1e23.webm?t=1761745227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727090/extras/27c7b762caf9061030cd5525959b1e23.mp4?t=1761745227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete training exercises and build up your horse\u2019s strength and confidence to qualify for competitions and earn prize money. Take your horses out on trail rides for a change of pace and scenery \u2013 you get to enjoy beautiful vistas and you never know what you might find along the way!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Breed &amp; Evolve</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727090/extras/6940656b2366d75bd3718a61e17b125a.poster.avif?t=1761745227\" width=900 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727090/extras/6940656b2366d75bd3718a61e17b125a.webm?t=1761745227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727090/extras/6940656b2366d75bd3718a61e17b125a.mp4?t=1761745227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breed adorable foals to improve your stock over time. Carefully plan your stallion and mare pairings to bring out the best in your offspring, whether you\u2019re going for looks or stats.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade &amp; Manage\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727090/extras/f1b24f9ca063bced93f0631ac2c2d7f4.poster.avif?t=1761745227\" width=900 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727090/extras/f1b24f9ca063bced93f0631ac2c2d7f4.webm?t=1761745227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save up for upgrading your buildings to make space for more horses and better meeting their needs. Hire staff to stay on top of care and training for a growing herd.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Learn about the game and real horses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727090/extras/1338dbba537d7e783f1e23056acf8c03.poster.avif?t=1761745227\" width=900 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727090/extras/1338dbba537d7e783f1e23056acf8c03.webm?t=1761745227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727090/extras/1338dbba537d7e783f1e23056acf8c03.mp4?t=1761745227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horses of Hoofprint Bay is made by three horse girls who care a lot about these animals. While not every aspect of the game is completely realistic, we strive to be accurate and educational in every way that doesn\u2019t compromise gameplay fun. An in-game library contains a lot of relevant equestrian knowledge about in-game and real life horses!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize and Modify</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727090/extras/c8c3a5bb94478bbaf9702ce127aa8a71.poster.avif?t=1761745227\" width=900 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727090/extras/c8c3a5bb94478bbaf9702ce127aa8a71.webm?t=1761745227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727090/extras/c8c3a5bb94478bbaf9702ce127aa8a71.mp4?t=1761745227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Edit the appearance of your character and tack items with built-in color picking tools, or even modify the game files to your liking to create custom color palettes. Whether you prefer sticking to a curated selection of available customization items and color combos, or want to start digging into easily accessible textures and text files to alter the appearance of horses and characters is entirely up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Thogli Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727090/05ecc629bbeefe5b64ea3acc33da82009bccf968/header.jpg?t=1761745227","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3727090/202884910/1d62f41c7cdd4c6f76b5d45f6cdc08630fa4706f/1761237224/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761745226","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3727090/202884910/1d62f41c7cdd4c6f76b5d45f6cdc08630fa4706f/1761237224/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761745226","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3727090/202884910/1d62f41c7cdd4c6f76b5d45f6